      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer entry — the PaintDivider wave below is pale pink/peach sitting
       between two dark-orange bands, so its own rectangular image edge reads
       as a hard line against both. This soft, blurred, oversized mass in the
       same pale tone feathers into the orange on both sides, masking that
       edge.
       BUG FIXED HERE (two bugs, actually): (1) --paint-ellipse-bias was
       previously named --paint-ellipse-top and applied as a percentage
       `top` — but .scene-seam is height:0, and a percentage `top` against
       a zero-height container always resolves to 0px, so that property
       never had any effect; the mass was ALWAYS centered on the seam via
       the transform's own -50% regardless of what was set. (2) centered
       that way, ~half its height (up to 230px) sat over final-cta's own
       CTA buttons — a scene-seam sits AFTER final-cta in DOM with equal
       z-index, so ties go to the seam and it painted over the buttons
       entirely (confirmed empirically: sampled pixel matched the
       ellipse's own color regardless of what was behind it). Measured
       clearance between the buttons and final-cta's bottom edge is only
       ~115px, so bias is now -8% (only ~8% of the rotated height bleeds
       up into final-cta's empty bottom padding — safe; the rest bleeds
       down into the footer transition where there is no text to cover).
       Any future seam that bleeds backward into a preceding section must
       keep its real (measured) upward reach within that section's real
       content-to-edge clearance, not just assume "half its height" is
       safe by default. -->
  <div class="scene-seam" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="paint-ellipse paint-ellipse--giant paint-ellipse--soft" style="--paint-ellipse-color:#FFD7C8; --paint-ellipse-tilt:-1.5deg; --paint-ellipse-bias:-8%; --paint-ellipse-opacity:0.85;"></div>
  </div>

  <PaintDivider variant="footer" asset="wave-pink-peach" flip depth={0.24} />
</BaseLayout>

<style lang="scss">
